sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Arduino
    participant Xendit
    User->>Frontend: Insert bill / enter mobile
    Frontend->>Backend: createPayment(amount, mobile)
    Backend->>Arduino: WAIT_FOR_BILLS
    Arduino->>Backend: BILL:100:0.97
    Backend->>Frontend: update amount
    Backend->>Xendit: create charge (GCash)
    Xendit-->>Backend: webhook (SUCCEEDED)
    Backend->>Arduino: VEND:1
    Arduino-->>Backend: ACK:VEND
    Backend->>Frontend: show success
